{"version":1,"content":"<p>Reddit與澳大利亞政府圍繞未成年人社交媒體使用限制的法律爭端，近日正式進入最高法院審理階段。Reddit不僅再次強調自己並不屬於法律所定義的社交媒體平台，還指責澳大利亞政府倉促推出的16歲以下用户禁令考慮不周、範圍過寬且執行效果有限，並認為相關法律侵犯了澳大利亞憲法所隱含保障的政治言論自由。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584876.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T14:01:26.081575+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":153,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T13:41:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T13:58:21.528940+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T13:58:21.528940+00:00","content_hash":"cb891b826ac97c9ace9adb4b8b9d3b6831f4ed1067e3044d4e1538d4761ee78c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}